cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this harness or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ple-sitecheck: a verifier-in-the-loop agent harness for engineering deliverables"
abstract: >-
  An agent harness for the Physical-Engineering's Last Exam (PLE) benchmark.
  It wraps a plain OpenAI-compatible tool-calling loop with token-free layers
  that inventory the task's documents, parse a deliverable checklist from the
  brief, open every deliverable after the model says it is done, and feed the
  findings back as bounded repair rounds.
authors:
