url: "https://github.com/bki-labs/ple-sitecheck"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-12
keywords:
  - LLM agents
  - agent harness
  - engineering deliverables
  - verification
  - Physical-Engineering's Last Exam
  - benchmark
